{"id":"2ee05b1995ae05f1","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-covariant-derivative.md","title":"Covariant Derivative","display":"df-covariant-derivative — Covariant Derivative","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-covariant-derivative","aliases":["58-df-covariant-derivative"],"display":"df-covariant-derivative — Covariant Derivative","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-derivative.md]]","[[58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-covariant-derivative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-covariant-derivative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-covariant-derivative — Covariant Derivative"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bb62713ade4dcadf\" href=\"?note=bb62713ade4dcadf\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md\">../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6ad876d2c15e685f\" href=\"?note=6ad876d2c15e685f\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-derivative.md\">../batch15/58-df-derivative.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f810bf542334e0d1\" href=\"?note=f810bf542334e0d1\" title=\"58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md\">58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k,D\\in V\">\\(\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k,D\\in V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\langle\\pi,E,M,k,S,r,A,O,\\mathcal T\\rangle\">\\(D=\\langle\\pi,E,M,k,S,r,A,O,\\mathcal T\\rangle\\)</span> 是书内 <code>58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data</code> 的记录，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\">\\(S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma(D)\">\\(\\Gamma(D)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega^1(D)\">\\(\\Omega^1(D)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ScalarSmooth}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{ScalarSmooth}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ScalarDifferential}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{ScalarDifferential}_{58}\\)</span>、截面逐点运算和纤维运算均由该依赖定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma^\\infty(E)\">\\(\\Gamma^\\infty(E)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega^1(M;E)\">\\(\\Omega^1(M;E)\\)</span> 在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 的环境中分别缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma(D)\">\\(\\Gamma(D)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega^1(D)\">\\(\\Omega^1(D)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CovDer}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CovDer}_S\\)</span> 保留五元兼容接口；显式结构版本是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}_{58}(\\nabla,D)\">\\(\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}_{58}(\\nabla,D)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下面 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 的全部分量为当前记录的投影；非法记录使相关谓词为假。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^I\">\\(V^I\\)</span> 仅表示定义域为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 的集合函数类。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SectionCombination}\">\\(\\mathrm{SectionCombination}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SectionProduct}\">\\(\\mathrm{SectionProduct}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f810bf542334e0d1\" href=\"?note=f810bf542334e0d1\" title=\"58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md\">58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}_{58}(\\nabla,D)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\n\\land\\nabla\\in\\Omega^1(D)^{\\Gamma(D)}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\Gamma(D)\\;\\forall a,b\\in k\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{SectionCombination}_{58}(D,a,s,b,t)\\in\\Gamma(D)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v\\in T(S,p)\\;\n\\nabla(\\mathrm{SectionCombination}_{58}(D,a,s,b,t))(p)(v)\n=A(p)(O(p)(a,\\nabla(s)(p)(v)),O(p)(b,\\nabla(t)(p)(v)))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in k^M\\;\\forall s\\in\\Gamma(D)\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{ScalarSmooth}_{58}(f,S,k)\\to\n\\mathrm{SectionProduct}_{58}(D,f,s)\\in\\Gamma(D)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v\\in T(S,p)\\;\n\\nabla(\\mathrm{SectionProduct}_{58}(D,f,s))(p)(v)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38mm}=A(p)(O(p)(\\mathrm{ScalarDifferential}_{58}(f,v,S,k),s(p)),O(p)(f(p),\\nabla(s)(p)(v)))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}_{58}(\\nabla,D)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\n\\land\\nabla\\in\\Omega^1(D)^{\\Gamma(D)}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\Gamma(D)\\;\\forall a,b\\in k\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{SectionCombination}_{58}(D,a,s,b,t)\\in\\Gamma(D)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v\\in T(S,p)\\;\n\\nabla(\\mathrm{SectionCombination}_{58}(D,a,s,b,t))(p)(v)\n=A(p)(O(p)(a,\\nabla(s)(p)(v)),O(p)(b,\\nabla(t)(p)(v)))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in k^M\\;\\forall s\\in\\Gamma(D)\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{ScalarSmooth}_{58}(f,S,k)\\to\n\\mathrm{SectionProduct}_{58}(D,f,s)\\in\\Gamma(D)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v\\in T(S,p)\\;\n\\nabla(\\mathrm{SectionProduct}_{58}(D,f,s))(p)(v)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38mm}=A(p)(O(p)(\\mathrm{ScalarDifferential}_{58}(f,v,S,k),s(p)),O(p)(f(p),\\nabla(s)(p)(v)))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CovDer}_S(\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\n\\land\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}_{58}(\\nabla,D)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CovDer}_S(\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\n\\land\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}_{58}(\\nabla,D)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}_{58}(\\nabla,D)\\land X\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\\land s\\in\\Gamma(D)\\to\n\\nabla_X^D s\\coloneqq\\{\\langle p,\\nabla(s)(p)(X(p))\\rangle:p\\in M\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}_{58}(\\nabla,D)\\land X\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\\land s\\in\\Gamma(D)\\to\n\\nabla_X^D s\\coloneqq\\{\\langle p,\\nabla(s)(p)(X(p))\\rangle:p\\in M\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>直接展开 k 线性和 Leibniz 法则，不再使用未给出元数的 Linear_k 或未构造的截面空间。五元接口不变，连续多次求协变导数时沿用同一记录 D。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md","status":"resolved","id":"bb62713ade4dcadf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-derivative.md","status":"resolved","id":"6ad876d2c15e685f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-derivative.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"f810bf542334e0d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"f810bf542334e0d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{SectionCombination}$、$\\mathrm{SectionProduct}$、$\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}$ 取 [[58-df-smooth-vector-bundle-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k,D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\langle\\pi,E,M,k,S,r,A,O,\\mathcal T\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega^1(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ScalarSmooth}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ScalarDifferential}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma^\\infty(E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega^1(M;E)","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega^1(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CovDer}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}_{58}(\\nabla,D)","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"V^I","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SectionCombination}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SectionProduct}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}_{58}(\\nabla,D)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\n\\land\\nabla\\in\\Omega^1(D)^{\\Gamma(D)}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\Gamma(D)\\;\\forall a,b\\in k\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{SectionCombination}_{58}(D,a,s,b,t)\\in\\Gamma(D)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v\\in T(S,p)\\;\n\\nabla(\\mathrm{SectionCombination}_{58}(D,a,s,b,t))(p)(v)\n=A(p)(O(p)(a,\\nabla(s)(p)(v)),O(p)(b,\\nabla(t)(p)(v)))\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall f\\in k^M\\;\\forall s\\in\\Gamma(D)\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{ScalarSmooth}_{58}(f,S,k)\\to\n\\mathrm{SectionProduct}_{58}(D,f,s)\\in\\Gamma(D)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v\\in T(S,p)\\;\n\\nabla(\\mathrm{SectionProduct}_{58}(D,f,s))(p)(v)\\\\\n&\\hspace{38mm}=A(p)(O(p)(\\mathrm{ScalarDifferential}_{58}(f,v,S,k),s(p)),O(p)(f(p),\\nabla(s)(p)(v)))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CovDer}_S(\\nabla,\\pi,E,M,k)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorBundleData}_{58}(D,\\pi,E,M,k)\n\\land\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}_{58}(\\nabla,D)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}_{58}(\\nabla,D)\\land X\\in\\mathfrak X(S)\\land s\\in\\Gamma(D)\\to\n\\nabla_X^D s\\coloneqq\\{\\langle p,\\nabla(s)(p)(X(p))\\rangle:p\\in M\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2774,"backlinks":[{"id":"904b0609d7cbf868","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{CovDer}$、$\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}$ 取 [[../batch17/58-df-covariant-derivative.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"0b88ba4114f012c8","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{CovariantDerivativeData}$ 取 [[../batch17/58-df-covariant-derivative.m